+The clinic publishes the veterinarians it employs with the specialties each holds, listed a page at a time. A veterinarian holding no specialty is shown as having none rather than left blank `[REQ-VET-001]`. The same directory is also published in a machine-readable form, for a caller that reads it as data rather than as a page. That form is a supported surface of the system, and it carries the same veterinarians and the same specialties as the page does `[REQ-VET-003]`.
