+Either form of the directory can be narrowed to the veterinarians holding one named specialty. The caller names that specialty as an optional `specialty` value on the request; the name must match a specialty in full, and letter case does not matter. A name no veterinarian holds narrows the directory to nothing rather than failing the request, and a blank name narrows nothing at all `[REQ-VET-004]`. The narrowed page is still listed a page at a time, and moving between its pages keeps the same specialty in force. The filter is part of the request address only: neither form of the directory gains a form field, a dropdown, or any other page control for it in this round.
 
